sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant Telegram
 participant Bot
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant Profile
 participant Поиск
 User->>Telegram: Other options / suitable / exclude
 Telegram->>Bot: Opaque callback token
 Bot->>DB: Validate owner, delivery, generation, TTL
 alt Other options
  Bot->>DB: Resolve shown canonical roots
  Bot->>Поиск: Same hard constraints, new generation, exclude shown
  Поиск-->>Bot: New recommendations or exhausted
 else Exclude
  Bot->>Profile: Explicit canonical exclusion
  Profile->>DB: Resolve alias and related entity rules
 else Suitable
  Bot->>DB: One positive feedback per delivery_card
 end
 Note over Bot,DB: Stale callback cannot mutate different user's state; /new keeps profile
